   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OCHA Yemen CAP 2010</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">OCHA Yemen CAP 2010</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xF6;d till OCHA som del av CAP Yemen 2010. Ing&#xE5;r finansiering f&#xF6;r OCHA (2 MSEK) och Emergency Relief Fund/ERF (7 MSEK). St&#xF6;det till OCHA v&#xE4;ntas st&#xE4;rka koordinering av humanit&#xE4;rt st&#xF6;d, inkl cluster, f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttrad katastrof-f&#xF6;rberedelse och f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttrad rapportering f&#xF6;r Early Warning-Early Action. ERF, nyligen etablerade i Yemen, s&#xE4;kerhetsst&#xE4;lla snabb och effektiv hantering av st&#xF6;d till hum. org.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to OCHA as part of the CAP Yemen 2010. Includes both funding to OCHA (2 MSEK) and the Emergency Relief Fund/ERF(7 MSEK). Support to OCHA is expected to strengthen coordination of humanitarian assistance, improved cluster approach, sthrengthened preparedness and contingency planning, Early Warning-Early Action reports updated. ERF recently established to ensure rapid funds for humanitarian agencies.</narrative>
  </description>
